{"channelId":"UCFCOcpAdfJ-RGDcOMptZBJw","row":["Carolina Active Health Chiropractic",150,"Our goal is simple:  We want to provide a natural, holistic, solution to your healthcare needs.  Our aim is to improve your life in any way we can, whether that is to live a pain free life or optimize your performance and wellness.  We focus on total optimization of each individual, focusing on the movement of the human body.  We use an evidence-based biomechanical and structural based approach to your care.  Treating in this method can not only resolve your condition more quickly, but can also prevent future conditions from occurring.\n\nContact our Greenville, South Carolina office today so we can help you achieve your goals.","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCFCOcpAdfJ-RGDcOMptZBJw","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCFCOcpAdfJ-RGDcOMptZBJw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:08:42.092Z","channelId":"UCFCOcpAdfJ-RGDcOMptZBJw","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"a66e37a45a5ffbe71c05e6d5aaaa56e7f1bffdc99ba6a0677e54396aaa757bef","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"482c57b6270aedb80991c61d351320a6a6a3dfeb9174ccd953887ba0cdc141c3"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCFCOcpAdfJ-RGDcOMptZBJw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:08:42.092Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCFCOcpAdfJ-RGDcOMptZBJw","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":150,"raw":"150 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCFCOcpAdfJ-RGDcOMptZBJw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:08:42.092Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"chiropractors","relevant":true,"evidenceLevel":"recurring_content","role":"undetermined","flags":["当前仅有相关内容或名称线索，尚无匹配的本人专业简介；不列入职业联系优选"],"sourceUrls":["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=C9DfYpJTkjY","https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=